Unreleased
----------

- Close the transport when a TLS handshake times out or fails.
- Verify that the server certificate names the URL's host; refuse a TLS URL
  with no host. Add `?ca_file` to `connect` and `with_connection`.
- `?timeout` of `connect` and `with_connection` is now a `Time_ns.Span.t`, and
  also bounds the TLS handshake.
- `with_connection` resolves the host through `Tcp.Where_to_connect`.
- Add `connect_rpc`.
- Update to async v0.17.

